A profile page lets a user edit their public profile. A hook seeds it from the server:

```tsx
function useProfile() {
  const [profile, setProfile] = useState(null);
  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);
  const [error, setError] = useState(null);
  useEffect(() => {
